{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the free <strong>demo</strong> version of <strong>Rabbit Rush</strong>, a fast-paced and intense action game where you control an agile rabbit that must complete each stage in just 10 seconds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/extras/4a3cd44b8fc33f7f77b92c9467f48747.poster.avif?t=1755198088\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/extras/4a3cd44b8fc33f7f77b92c9467f48747.webm?t=1755198088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/extras/4a3cd44b8fc33f7f77b92c9467f48747.mp4?t=1755198088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the Demo, you can:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>2 worlds</strong> with <strong>12 levels</strong> from the early part of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a selection of introductory enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the \u201csharp carrot\u201d mechanic and high-speed controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the retro-style visuals and fast-paced soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/extras/bae79d77b683303eb65be73394123513.poster.avif?t=1755198088\" width=906 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/extras/bae79d77b683303eb65be73394123513.webm?t=1755198088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949020/ex